<h2 id="what-this-proves">What this proves</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Point</th><th>Contract</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Turns 1–2</td><td><code>WeatherStep</code> stays active until a supported pair of cities is supplied.</td></tr><tr><td>Turn 3</td><td>Tool work advances through two <code>LogicStep</code>s without a model decision before Favorites becomes active.</td></tr><tr><td>Turn 4</td><td><code>FavoritesStep.onResponse()</code> parses structured text and routes to Name.</td></tr><tr><td>Turns 5–6</td><td>Name validation rejects a placeholder, then nested child work runs without taking the durable cursor.</td></tr><tr><td>Turn 8</td><td>Address validation stores accepted state and the terminal step completes the session.</td></tr></tbody></table>

